    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti̱em Jɔ-cua kɛ Ya-bin kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, mëë ci Ya-bin kuäär Ɣa-dhor theŋ, cuɛ Yo-bab kuäär Ma-dhön la̱r lär kɛnɛ kuäär Cim-rɔn kɛ kuäär Ak-cap, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni kua̱r tëë te caam päämni kɛnɛ tëë te kä Ä-ra-ba cueec Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, kɛnɛ tin te peek rööl in ta̱p, kɛnɛ tin te kä kony cäŋ kä Na-poth-dor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu amäni kua̱r rɛ̈kni Kɛ-naan tin te kä käny cäŋ kɛnɛ kony cäŋ, kɛnɛ nɛy diaal ti̱ti̱ tin ciaŋkɛ ni dhɔr päämni, ji̱ Ɛ-mor, kɛ ji̱ Ɣɛ̈th, kɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi, kɛ ji̱ Yɛ-buth amäni ji̱ Iwi thaar pa̱a̱m Ɛr-mon rɛy rööl Midh-pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ben raar kɛn diaal amäni rɛmkiɛn /ciɛ nath bä kä päär pëkdiɛn kɛ nyin lidä thuɔk yiëër. Kɛn tekɛ kɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱kni ti ŋuan kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛli ti yɔ̱a̱ckɛ ɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kua̱r ti̱ti̱ diaal rɔ̱ mat kɛɛl kä cukɛ ben pua̱t guäth kɛl mi cɔal i̱ gua̱a̱th lo̱o̱lä Me-rom kɛ ɣöö bikɛ ben nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Jɔ-cua jiök i̱, “/Cu kɛ luth, kɛ ɣöö iruun kɛ jɛn thaak ɛmɛ pa̱ny, ɣän bäkɛ näk nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Yɛn bia jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱knikiɛn duäny ciökni kä bia thurbiɛɛlikiɛn waŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Jɔ-cua kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal kɛ ku mam piny guäth lo̱o̱lä Me-rom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ ka̱m ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cukɛ kɛ näk kä cukɛ kɛ juɔc ni rɛɛk Dhi-don in di̱i̱t amäni Mith-rɛ-poth-ma-yim kɛnɛ pan Midh-pee kä käny cäŋ. Kä cuɛ kɛ näk a /ke̱rɛ kɛ pa̱l duɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jɔ-cua lät nikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r jɛ, cuɛ ciök jio̱o̱kni tuɔ̱ruɔ̱knikiɛn dua̱a̱ny kä cuɛ thurbiɛɛlikiɛn waŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu Jɔ-cua rɔ rieet jɔk kä cuɛ Ɣa-dhor ben ka̱n kä cuɛ kuäärɛ näk, kɛ ɣöö Ɣa-dhor ɛ jɛn ëë mat wuɔ̱th wi̱i̱ni ti̱ti̱ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ji̱kɛ diaal riam kɛ mut, cua kɛ dup, thilɛ ram kɛl mi cua duɔ̱th yiëë, kä cu Jɔ-cua ɛ cua̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɛ̈k kua̱ri ti̱ti̱ diaal amäni kua̱rkiɛn kɛɛl tiam kä cuɛ kɛ näk kɛn diaal. Cuɛ kɛ nor nikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r jɛ kɛ thok kuanyädɛ ni Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ rɛ̈k diaal tëë cuŋ wuɔ̱thni biɛɛni päl ɛ ni Ɣa-dhor kärɔa ɛ nëë cuɛ cua̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat I-thɛ-rɛl kuak rɛ̈kni tɔ̱tɔ̱ ka̱p rɔ̱ amäni ɣɔ̱kiɛn, ɛ ni min cɔal i̱ raan kɛɛliw cukɛ näk kɛ mut amäni mëë cuɛ thil ram mi ŋot kɛ tɛ̈k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëë diaal tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱t kuanydɛ ni Muthɛ, cu Muthɛ kɛ lɛni la̱th ji̱th Jɔ-cua, kä Jɔ-cua puɔ̱nydɛ cuɛ kɛ liŋ. Cuɛ tëë diaal tëë ca gik kä Muthɛ ɛ Kuoth Nhial la̱t nikɛ ta̱a̱ in görkɛ ɛ Kuoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pëk rööl ëë ci Jɔ-cua ɛ käp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ inɔ, cu Jɔ-cua wec ku ka̱n kɛɛliwdɛ, dhɔr päämni, kɛ Nɛ-gɛb kɛɛliw, amäni mun Go-cɛn kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ dhɔr täpä, kɛ pan Ä-ra-ba, kɛnɛ ro̱l päämni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl amäni täpkɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni kä päm in cɔal i̱ A-lak in wä kui̱c rööl Ɛ-dɔm wëë yiath ni Baal-gad rɛy täpä Lɛ-ba-nɔn carä piɛny pa̱a̱m Ɛr-mon. Kä cuɛ kua̱rkiɛn diaal ka̱p cuɛ pɛn näkdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn cuɛ ko̱r tɛr kɛ kɛn kua̱r ti̱ti̱ kɛ pëk ni̱ni ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ rɛk mi maar kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ ni ji̱ Iwi tin cieŋ kä Gib-yon. Duɔthkiɛn diaal tɔ̱ cukɛ kɛ puɔ̱t ni ko̱o̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ɛ ca̱p Kuɔth Nhial ɛ nëë jak lo̱ckiɛn kä bum ɛ tet ɛn ɣöö bikɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ben mak kɛ ko̱r, kɛ ɣöö Kuoth Nhial go̱o̱rɛ ni ɣöö ba kɛ däk ɛwic, kä thilɛ pälikä mi bi kɛn ɛ je̱k kä ɛni ɣöö ba kɛ näk, nikɛ mëë cɛ la̱t Muthɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ inɔ, cu Jɔ-cua ku ben kä cuɛ ji̱ Ä-nak ben töl raar röli päämnikiɛn, kä Ɣɛb-ron, kɛ Dɛ-bir, kɛ Ä-nab, kɛnɛ röl päämni Juda diaal amäni wi̱c päämni I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. Cu Jɔ-cua kɛ nor kɛɛl amäni rɛ̈kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ram kɛl kä ji̱ Ä-nak mi cu duɔth ro̱o̱l I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ ni tëë tɔt tëë duɔth kä Gadha, kɛ Gɛ̈th, kɛ Ac-dod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, cu Jɔ-cua ro̱l käp ni kɛɛliwdɛ nikɛ dup diaal tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ gik kä Muthɛ. Kä cu Jɔ-cua ɛ ka̱m gaat I-thɛ-rɛl ala mun gua̱ndɔɔŋnikiɛn kä cuɛ jɛ däk kä kɛ nikɛ gua̱th tin yiathkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ döörkiɛn diaal. Kä cu wec cu lɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ ko̱o̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
